FS-COMMIT-076 provenance

The added host commit/mount tracking and synthetic tests are original work.
The patch carries context and adaptations to SuperMarioWonderRecomp runtime
hle_fs.cpp at 010ed7a596a621c15d3a8dfa5795ca8c3668b066 (BelmanteGu).
Its full applicable MIT notice follows below.

Comparison-only references inspected from private pinned source receipts:
- peiikai/LASRecomp 09f8e5ebf28aeefd6daa1456c73ae1b7a51efec5,
  runtime/services/fs.c (MIT).
- raulzrrs/letsgo-recomp 884f6d78035e537653c36579178cb0bb0c0b4f1d,
  runtime/services/fs.c (MIT).
No source from either comparison reference is copied/adapted into this patch.
They informed host-error/flush analysis only. Their no-op filesystem commits,
title hooks and save-root policies are not used. In particular, their file flush
calls do not by themselves check/report host sync failure; the new code does.
Game-derived SDK evidence was inspected read-only and is not distributed.

